{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e14-scene-06",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "拿回学位的机会  (A Second Chance at Her Degree)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "fang": "方老师",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Moments after Chun Yuqiao assigns her a case-study paper, Professor Fang calls from Media College with news that Bu Xiaogu can submit a thesis this year to earn back her lost degree. Listen to their phone call first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，方老师！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "小谷啊，你最近好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "挺好的，我真没想到您会给我打电话。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "我长话短说，你离开学校快一年了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "现在有个很好的机会，你可以跟今年的硕士一起提交论文。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "如果顺利的话，可以把去年丢掉的学位拿回来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "你现在数据补齐了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "方老师，我有一个新的选题，我觉得比去年的好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果您有空的话，我希望您能帮我看一看，给我一点意见。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，方老师！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, Professor Fang!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "小谷啊，你最近好吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, how have you been lately?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "挺好的，我真没想到您会给我打电话。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Doing really well—I never expected you would call me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "我长话短说，你离开学校快一年了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me keep a long story short: you left campus nearly a year ago.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "现在有个很好的机会，你可以跟今年的硕士一起提交论文。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right now there is a great opportunity for you to submit a thesis alongside this year's master's class.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "如果顺利的话，可以把去年丢掉的学位拿回来。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If all goes smoothly, you can earn back the degree you missed last year.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真的吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Really?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "你现在数据补齐了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Have you finished gathering the missing data from last year?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "方老师，我有一个新的选题，我觉得比去年的好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Professor Fang, I have a brand-new thesis topic that I think is even stronger than last year's.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果您有空的话，我希望您能帮我看一看，给我一点意见。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you have time, I hope you can take a look and give me your feedback.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，方老师！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "小谷啊，你最近好吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "挺好的，我真没想到您会给我打电话。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "我长话短说，你离开学校快一年了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "现在有个很好的机会，你可以跟今年的硕士一起提交论文。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "如果顺利的话，可以把去年丢掉的学位拿回来。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "真的吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "你现在数据补齐了吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "方老师，我有一个新的选题，我觉得比去年的好。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果您有空的话，我希望您能帮我看一看，给我一点意见。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Bu Xiaogu realises immediately that Chun Yuqiao quietly arranged her second chance with Media College behind the scenes. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "fang",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
